[{"text": "Hello, English learners. Welcome back to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.4599999999999982, "end": 5.0}, {"text": "And I'm Erica.", "start": 5.22, "end": 5.82}, {"text": "And today we're bringing you another great lesson for all of you who are interested in shopping.", "start": 6.18, "end": 10.18}, {"text": "Especially those of you who are interested in shopping for a car.", "start": 10.58, "end": 14.14}, {"text": "A car, exactly. So we're going to give you some great language about describing a car or characteristics of a car.", "start": 14.28, "end": 20.0}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 20.14, "end": 20.32}, {"text": "And also some really interesting language for shopping.", "start": 20.66, "end": 24.0}, {"text": "Yes, especially buying something really big and expensive.", "start": 24.3, "end": 27.42}, {"text": "Yeah, like a car.", "start": 27.86, "end": 28.48}, {"text": "So before we listen to our dialogue, let's take a look at Vocabulary Preview.", "start": 28.48, "end": 32.68}, {"text": "Vocabulary Preview.", "start": 33.92000000000001, "end": 35.04}, {"text": "On Vocabulary Preview today, we're bringing you two words.", "start": 35.52, "end": 38.44}, {"text": "The first one is vehicle.", "start": 38.62, "end": 40.54}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 41.38, "end": 41.94}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 42.46, "end": 43.02}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 43.22, "end": 43.78}, {"text": "So again, a vehicle is a machine, right?", "start": 44.2, "end": 47.4}, {"text": "Right, a machine that carries people from one place to another.", "start": 47.58, "end": 50.74}, {"text": "So it's important to say that a vehicle could be an airplane.", "start": 51.1, "end": 54.6}, {"text": "A car.", "start": 54.9, "end": 55.88}, {"text": "A car.", "start": 56.02, "end": 56.48}, {"text": "A boat.", "start": 56.68, "end": 57.14}, {"text": "A boat.", "start": 57.38, "end": 57.74}, {"text": "Even a bicycle.", "start": 57.74, "end": 58.54}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 58.82, "end": 59.08}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 59.3, "end": 59.44}, {"text": "That's a vehicle.", "start": 59.54, "end": 60.28}, {"text": "Our second word is sedan.", "start": 60.9, "end": 63.44}, {"text": "Sedan.", "start": 64.02, "end": 64.62}, {"text": "Sedan.", "start": 65.0, "end": 65.6}, {"text": "Sedan.", "start": 65.84, "end": 66.44}, {"text": "So a sedan is a type of car.", "start": 66.8, "end": 69.7}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 69.82, "end": 70.24}, {"text": "It's a type of car with four doors that can fit five people inside.", "start": 70.24, "end": 74.64}, {"text": "So to make it more clear, most taxis are sedans.", "start": 75.0, "end": 78.66}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 78.84, "end": 79.18}, {"text": "Right?", "start": 79.52, "end": 79.7}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 79.84, "end": 79.96}, {"text": "They have four doors.", "start": 79.96, "end": 81.0}, {"text": "Five people can fit in there, including the driver.", "start": 81.12, "end": 83.28}, {"text": "Except taxis in Mexico.", "start": 83.58, "end": 85.02}, {"text": "They're not sedans?", "start": 85.52, "end": 86.3}, {"text": "They're little beetles.", "start": 86.4, "end": 87.44}, {"text": "Oh.", "start": 87.74, "end": 87.98}, {"text": "They're Volkswagen Beetles.", "start": 88.32, "end": 89.34}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 89.42, "end": 89.6}, {"text": "So those are not sedans.", "start": 89.6, "end": 90.66}, {"text": "But yeah, most countries have sedans as taxis.", "start": 90.9, "end": 93.88}, {"text": "To give you some examples, like a Toyota Corolla or a Toyota Camry is a sedan.", "start": 94.06, "end": 98.08}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 98.08, "end": 98.5}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 98.74, "end": 98.84}, {"text": "Maybe like a Volkswagen Jetta.", "start": 99.08, "end": 100.92}, {"text": "Is that it?", "start": 101.2, "end": 101.5}, {"text": "A Jetta?", "start": 101.62, "end": 102.0}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 102.14, "end": 102.26}, {"text": "A Jetta is a sedan.", "start": 102.4, "end": 103.02}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 103.26, "end": 103.34}, {"text": "Now we can listen to our dialogue, and it's going to be at a normal speed the first time,", "start": 103.34, "end": 107.24}, {"text": "but you don't have to worry about it.", "start": 107.34, "end": 108.58}, {"text": "We'll come back and teach you some of the important words from the dialogue.", "start": 108.68, "end": 112.12}, {"text": "Hi there.", "start": 120.46000000000001, "end": 121.06}, {"text": "Can I help you folks?", "start": 121.06, "end": 121.7}, {"text": "I'm just browsing, seeing what's on the lot.", "start": 124.10000000000001, "end": 126.9}, {"text": "My daughter wants a car for her birthday.", "start": 127.34, "end": 128.9}, {"text": "You know how it is.", "start": 129.08, "end": 129.76}, {"text": "Dad, I'm 16 already.", "start": 130.1, "end": 132.42}, {"text": "And I'm like the only one at school who doesn't have a car.", "start": 132.42, "end": 135.72}, {"text": "She's right, you know.", "start": 136.04, "end": 136.94}, {"text": "Kids these days all have cars.", "start": 137.24, "end": 138.6}, {"text": "Let me show you something we just got in.", "start": 138.94, "end": 140.38}, {"text": "A 1996 sedan.", "start": 140.46, "end": 141.92}, {"text": "Excellent gas mileage.", "start": 142.32, "end": 143.46}, {"text": "It has dual airbags and anti-lac brakes.", "start": 143.72, "end": 145.62}, {"text": "A perfect vehicle for a young driver.", "start": 145.74, "end": 147.56}, {"text": "Dad, I love it.", "start": 148.08, "end": 149.26}, {"text": "It's awesome.", "start": 149.32, "end": 150.06}, {"text": "Can we get this one, please?", "start": 150.44, "end": 151.96}, {"text": "I see.", "start": 153.20000000000002, "end": 154.08}, {"text": "What can you tell me about this one?", "start": 154.28, "end": 156.08}, {"text": "Oh, that's just an old World War II tank that we use for TV commercials.", "start": 157.58, "end": 161.22}, {"text": "Now about this sedan.", "start": 161.22, "end": 162.56}, {"text": "Whoa, whoa, wait a minute.", "start": 162.82, "end": 163.88}, {"text": "Tell me more about this tank.", "start": 164.14, "end": 165.54}, {"text": "Well, sir, if you are looking for quality and safety, then look no further.", "start": 167.38, "end": 171.7}, {"text": "Three inches of reinforced steel protect your daughter from short-range missile attacks.", "start": 172.32, "end": 176.44}, {"text": "Does the sedan protect her from missile attacks?", "start": 177.08, "end": 180.28}, {"text": "It does not.", "start": 180.5, "end": 181.12}, {"text": "Well, I don't know.", "start": 181.62, "end": 182.72}, {"text": "Let me sleep on it.", "start": 183.22, "end": 184.02}, {"text": "Did I mention the tank is a tank?", "start": 184.4, "end": 186.42}, {"text": "I'll take it.", "start": 186.58, "end": 187.32}, {"text": "Dad.", "start": 187.32, "end": 188.04}, {"text": "", "start": 188.54, "end": 188.54}, {"text": "I think she's really lucky.", "start": 196.8, "end": 198.34}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 198.66, "end": 198.9}, {"text": "She's getting a tank to go to school.", "start": 199.14, "end": 200.98}, {"text": "How awesome is that?", "start": 200.98, "end": 202.14}, {"text": "I would be so embarrassed if I had to drive to school in a tank.", "start": 202.3, "end": 205.86}, {"text": "It's like the coolest car.", "start": 205.86, "end": 207.08}, {"text": "Oh, you're such a boy.", "start": 207.2, "end": 208.22}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 209.29999999999998, "end": 210.14}, {"text": "A surprising ending to a relatively easy shopping day.", "start": 210.24, "end": 214.82}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 215.1, "end": 215.24}, {"text": "Let's take a look at some language that we saw in our dialogue on language takeaway.", "start": 215.64, "end": 219.96}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 221.46, "end": 222.72}, {"text": "We have four words for you today.", "start": 223.88, "end": 226.46}, {"text": "The first one is gas mileage.", "start": 226.74, "end": 230.08}, {"text": "Gas mileage.", "start": 230.44, "end": 231.56}, {"text": "Gas mileage.", "start": 231.56, "end": 232.52}, {"text": "Gas mileage.", "start": 232.88, "end": 234.02}, {"text": "So gas mileage is how many miles you can travel on a gallon or liter of gasoline.", "start": 235.46, "end": 240.9}, {"text": "Well, you know what's interesting?", "start": 241.06, "end": 241.94}, {"text": "In some English-speaking countries like Australia, New Zealand, Canada, we use kilometers to measure distance.", "start": 241.94, "end": 248.14}, {"text": "But we still talk about gas mileage.", "start": 248.14, "end": 251.2}, {"text": "Hmm.", "start": 251.68, "end": 251.98}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 252.36, "end": 252.54}, {"text": "I guess you can't say gas kilomileage.", "start": 252.54, "end": 255.64}, {"text": "No.", "start": 255.98, "end": 256.18}, {"text": "Or something like that.", "start": 256.64, "end": 257.76}, {"text": "But yeah, it's basically how many kilometers or how many miles you can travel on a tank or on a liter or gallon of gas.", "start": 258.26, "end": 266.4}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 266.56, "end": 266.88}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 267.82, "end": 268.2}, {"text": "The next word is airbags.", "start": 268.64, "end": 271.38}, {"text": "Airbags.", "start": 271.8, "end": 272.36}, {"text": "Airbags.", "start": 272.7, "end": 273.26}, {"text": "Airbags.", "start": 273.78, "end": 274.34}, {"text": "Airbags.", "start": 274.34, "end": 274.66}, {"text": "These are like big bags of air that fill up and come out of the car when there's a crash.", "start": 274.86, "end": 280.24}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 280.44, "end": 280.68}, {"text": "So that way you don't hit your head against the steering wheel or something like that.", "start": 280.68, "end": 284.82}, {"text": "So they protect you.", "start": 284.9, "end": 285.78}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 285.98, "end": 286.26}, {"text": "I've heard that Volvo has like 18 airbags now in their cars.", "start": 286.4, "end": 289.36}, {"text": "They are very safe cars, you know.", "start": 289.54, "end": 291.68}, {"text": "Like a big balloon.", "start": 292.0, "end": 293.14}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 293.4, "end": 293.62}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 294.12, "end": 294.32}, {"text": "Our third word today is brakes.", "start": 294.34, "end": 296.42}, {"text": "Brakes.", "start": 297.08, "end": 297.64}, {"text": "Brakes.", "start": 298.0, "end": 298.56}, {"text": "Brakes.", "start": 298.78, "end": 299.26}, {"text": "So what are brakes?", "start": 299.5, "end": 300.7}, {"text": "Brakes are little...", "start": 301.24, "end": 303.08}, {"text": "What are brakes?", "start": 303.08, "end": 303.6}, {"text": "Brakes are what make your car stop.", "start": 303.78, "end": 306.22}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 306.62, "end": 306.94}, {"text": "So they're the little machines maybe that stop your car?", "start": 307.08, "end": 310.56}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 310.68, "end": 310.8}, {"text": "They're on the wheels.", "start": 310.96, "end": 311.58}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 311.78, "end": 311.92}, {"text": "They make your car stop.", "start": 312.02, "end": 313.0}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 313.3, "end": 313.5}, {"text": "You have brakes on your bike.", "start": 313.6, "end": 314.68}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 314.88, "end": 315.12}, {"text": "On your car, etc.", "start": 315.3, "end": 316.82}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 317.18, "end": 317.46}, {"text": "Our last word today on language takeaway.", "start": 318.06, "end": 320.18}, {"text": "Reinforced.", "start": 321.0, "end": 321.4}, {"text": "Reinforced.", "start": 322.54, "end": 322.94}, {"text": "Reinforced.", "start": 324.0, "end": 324.4}, {"text": "Reinforced.", "start": 324.98, "end": 325.38}, {"text": "So we have some examples of how we use reinforced because it's a little bit weird.", "start": 325.64, "end": 329.9}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 330.18, "end": 330.28}, {"text": "These will help you understand the meaning.", "start": 330.28, "end": 331.98}, {"text": "Reinforced.", "start": 333.29999999999995, "end": 333.9}, {"text": "Example 1.", "start": 333.9, "end": 334.6}, {"text": "So I reinforced all the walls.", "start": 340.66, "end": 342.94}, {"text": "There's no way they're going to fall down.", "start": 343.16, "end": 344.78}, {"text": "Example 2.", "start": 350.8, "end": 351.7}, {"text": "This plastic is reinforced with a glass, so it's both light and strong.", "start": 356.7, "end": 361.04}, {"text": "So basically anything that's reinforced is made stronger.", "start": 364.94, "end": 368.56}, {"text": "Perfect.", "start": 368.9, "end": 369.26}, {"text": "Reinforced steel.", "start": 369.52, "end": 370.32}, {"text": "Reinforced table.", "start": 370.52, "end": 371.24}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 371.52, "end": 371.7}, {"text": "Anything.", "start": 371.74, "end": 371.94}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 372.28, "end": 372.5}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 372.9, "end": 373.44}, {"text": "So now we can listen to our dialogue again.", "start": 373.56, "end": 375.18}, {"text": "You can practice all these words that we just talked about, and we'll come back shortly.", "start": 375.18, "end": 378.76}, {"text": "Hi there.", "start": 384.7, "end": 385.66}, {"text": "Can I help you folks?", "start": 385.98, "end": 387.54}, {"text": "I'm just browsing, seeing what's on the lot.", "start": 388.28000000000003, "end": 391.82}, {"text": "My daughter wants a car for her birthday.", "start": 392.2, "end": 394.78}, {"text": "You know how it is.", "start": 395.24, "end": 396.6}, {"text": "Dad, I'm 16 already, and I'm like the only one at school who doesn't have a car.", "start": 396.9, "end": 403.8}, {"text": "She is right, you know.", "start": 403.8, "end": 405.76}, {"text": "Kids these days all have cars.", "start": 406.18, "end": 408.56}, {"text": "Let me show you something we just got in.", "start": 409.14, "end": 411.9}, {"text": "A 1996 sedan.", "start": 412.1, "end": 414.64}, {"text": "Excellent gas mileage.", "start": 415.66, "end": 417.22}, {"text": "It has dual airbags and anti-lock brakes.", "start": 417.52, "end": 421.18}, {"text": "A perfect vehicle for a young driver.", "start": 421.54, "end": 424.16}, {"text": "Dad, I love it.", "start": 424.66, "end": 426.6}, {"text": "It's awesome.", "start": 427.12, "end": 428.46}, {"text": "Can we get this one, please?", "start": 428.88, "end": 430.78}, {"text": "I see.", "start": 431.64, "end": 432.76}, {"text": "What can you tell me about this one?", "start": 433.28, "end": 435.94}, {"text": "Oh, that's just an old World War II tank that we use for TV commercials.", "start": 438.03999999999996, "end": 443.88}, {"text": "Now, about this sedan.", "start": 444.18, "end": 446.12}, {"text": "Whoa, whoa, wait a minute.", "start": 446.88, "end": 449.24}, {"text": "Tell me more about this tank.", "start": 449.58, "end": 451.6}, {"text": "Well, sir.", "start": 452.78, "end": 454.08}, {"text": "If you are looking for quality and safety, then look no further.", "start": 454.54, "end": 460.12}, {"text": "Three inches of reinforced steel protect your daughter from short-range missile attacks.", "start": 460.58, "end": 466.64}, {"text": "Does the sedan protect her from missile attacks?", "start": 467.08, "end": 470.74}, {"text": "It does not.", "start": 471.4, "end": 472.62}, {"text": "Well, I don't know.", "start": 473.26, "end": 475.38}, {"text": "Let me sleep on it.", "start": 475.76, "end": 477.22}, {"text": "Did I mention the tank is a tank?", "start": 477.48, "end": 480.28}, {"text": "I'll take it.", "start": 480.28, "end": 482.4}, {"text": "Dad.", "start": 482.98, "end": 483.58}, {"text": "So we have a couple of interesting phrases to talk about shopping.", "start": 489.98, "end": 494.06}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 494.42, "end": 494.82}, {"text": "Let's look at these in Fluency Builder.", "start": 495.16, "end": 497.16}, {"text": "Fluency Builder.", "start": 498.0, "end": 499.3}, {"text": "The first one today is, I'm just browsing.", "start": 499.3, "end": 502.6}, {"text": "I'm just browsing.", "start": 503.18, "end": 504.86}, {"text": "I'm just browsing.", "start": 505.24, "end": 506.44}, {"text": "I'm just browsing.", "start": 506.7, "end": 507.58}, {"text": "This is a really useful phrase because usually salespeople will come up to you and ask you,", "start": 507.86, "end": 512.92}, {"text": "can I help you?", "start": 512.98, "end": 513.54}, {"text": "Are you interested in something?", "start": 513.64, "end": 514.44}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 514.62, "end": 514.76}, {"text": "And you're just looking.", "start": 515.02, "end": 515.92}, {"text": "Yeah, maybe you don't really want to buy today.", "start": 516.22, "end": 518.44}, {"text": "So you're just, I'm just browsing.", "start": 518.72, "end": 520.52}, {"text": "So then they'll just leave you alone.", "start": 520.76, "end": 522.8}, {"text": "Yeah, they won't bother you as much.", "start": 522.96, "end": 524.38}, {"text": "Yeah, it's a good, good phrase.", "start": 524.68, "end": 526.14}, {"text": "Another good phrase.", "start": 526.14, "end": 527.36}, {"text": "Sleep on it.", "start": 528.34, "end": 529.34}, {"text": "Sleep on it.", "start": 529.4, "end": 530.36}, {"text": "Sleep on it.", "start": 530.64, "end": 531.66}, {"text": "Sleep on it.", "start": 531.76, "end": 532.68}, {"text": "So we have some examples of how we use sleep on it.", "start": 532.92, "end": 535.86}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 537.1, "end": 537.96}, {"text": "I don't know if we should buy that house.", "start": 542.2, "end": 544.52}, {"text": "It's perfect for us, but it's so expensive.", "start": 544.76, "end": 547.72}, {"text": "Let's sleep on it.", "start": 548.4, "end": 549.24}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 554.74, "end": 555.58}, {"text": "Why don't you sleep on it and tell me tomorrow?", "start": 559.3, "end": 561.9}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 567.94, "end": 568.76}, {"text": "This is a bit more than what I can afford.", "start": 572.42, "end": 574.4}, {"text": "Let me sleep on it.", "start": 574.76, "end": 575.56}, {"text": "To sleep on it means to...", "start": 579.6400000000001, "end": 582.02}, {"text": "Like to think about it overnight.", "start": 582.02, "end": 583.56}, {"text": "To think about it.", "start": 583.78, "end": 584.54}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 584.64, "end": 584.74}, {"text": "Right?", "start": 584.74, "end": 584.88}, {"text": "So maybe you want to buy this really expensive car.", "start": 585.14, "end": 588.46}, {"text": "But you need to think about it.", "start": 588.68, "end": 589.74}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 589.84, "end": 590.08}, {"text": "So you'll sleep on it.", "start": 590.24, "end": 591.38}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 591.48, "end": 591.86}, {"text": "You go home, sleep on it, think about it twice, and then make a decision.", "start": 592.06, "end": 595.82}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 596.02, "end": 596.32}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 596.84, "end": 597.14}, {"text": "Great words and great dialogue.", "start": 597.3, "end": 598.64}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 598.84, "end": 599.16}, {"text": "I love this dialogue.", "start": 599.16, "end": 600.06}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 600.32, "end": 600.42}, {"text": "It's kind of funny.", "start": 600.42, "end": 601.48}, {"text": "So we could listen to it again, and then we'll come back and talk a little bit about it.", "start": 601.66, "end": 605.16}, {"text": "Hi there.", "start": 619.52, "end": 619.92}, {"text": "Can I help you folks?", "start": 619.98, "end": 620.56}, {"text": "", "start": 620.56, "end": 620.56}, {"text": "I'm just browsing, seeing what's on the lot.", "start": 622.96, "end": 625.76}, {"text": "My daughter wants a car for her birthday.", "start": 626.16, "end": 627.76}, {"text": "You know how it is.", "start": 627.9, "end": 628.6}, {"text": "Dad, I'm 16 already, and I'm like the only one at school who doesn't have a car.", "start": 628.6, "end": 634.58}, {"text": "She's right, you know.", "start": 634.9, "end": 635.8}, {"text": "Kids these days all have cars.", "start": 636.02, "end": 637.48}, {"text": "Let me show you something we just got in.", "start": 637.74, "end": 639.22}, {"text": "A 1996 sedan.", "start": 639.32, "end": 640.78}, {"text": "Excellent gas mileage.", "start": 641.18, "end": 642.32}, {"text": "It has dual airbags and anti-lac brakes.", "start": 642.56, "end": 644.48}, {"text": "A perfect vehicle for a young driver.", "start": 644.62, "end": 646.42}, {"text": "Dad, I love it.", "start": 646.92, "end": 648.1}, {"text": "It's awesome.", "start": 648.18, "end": 648.92}, {"text": "Can we get this one, please?", "start": 649.44, "end": 650.82}, {"text": "I see.", "start": 652.06, "end": 652.94}, {"text": "What can you tell me about this one?", "start": 653.12, "end": 654.94}, {"text": "Oh, that's just an old World War II tank that we use for TV commercials.", "start": 656.3399999999999, "end": 660.12}, {"text": "Now about this sedan.", "start": 660.4, "end": 661.42}, {"text": "Whoa, whoa, wait a minute.", "start": 661.62, "end": 662.74}, {"text": "Tell me more about this tank.", "start": 663.02, "end": 664.4}, {"text": "Well, sir, if you are looking for quality and safety, then look no further.", "start": 666.26, "end": 670.56}, {"text": "Three inches of reinforced steel protect your daughter from short-range missile attacks.", "start": 671.12, "end": 675.32}, {"text": "Does the sedan protect her from missile attacks?", "start": 675.98, "end": 679.14}, {"text": "It does not.", "start": 679.36, "end": 679.98}, {"text": "Well, I don't know.", "start": 680.5, "end": 681.62}, {"text": "Let me sleep on it.", "start": 682.08, "end": 682.88}, {"text": "Did I mention the tank is a tank?", "start": 682.88, "end": 685.26}, {"text": "I'll take it.", "start": 685.46, "end": 686.2}, {"text": "Dad.", "start": 686.52, "end": 686.96}, {"text": "So, Marco, have you ever driven a tank?", "start": 693.6, "end": 696.24}, {"text": "I mean, I know you're in the Army.", "start": 697.86, "end": 699.66}, {"text": "Yeah, actually, I did.", "start": 702.04, "end": 703.32}, {"text": "I did drive a tank before.", "start": 703.32, "end": 705.4}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 705.62, "end": 705.76}, {"text": "Yeah, really old one.", "start": 706.02, "end": 707.38}, {"text": "Kind of like a World War II type tank.", "start": 707.48, "end": 709.18}, {"text": "But yeah, they're really fun and interesting.", "start": 709.54, "end": 710.72}, {"text": "You have, it's not like driving a normal car.", "start": 710.72, "end": 712.84}, {"text": "You have pedals.", "start": 712.84, "end": 713.66}, {"text": "So there's no steering wheel?", "start": 713.94, "end": 715.06}, {"text": "No, no, no.", "start": 715.12, "end": 715.84}, {"text": "You have levers.", "start": 715.92, "end": 717.2}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 717.48, "end": 717.72}, {"text": "And what many people don't know is that actually tanks are manual transmissions.", "start": 718.02, "end": 723.42}, {"text": "You have to change gears.", "start": 723.56, "end": 724.52}, {"text": "Oh, really?", "start": 724.84, "end": 725.32}, {"text": "And it's really hard to change gears on those things.", "start": 725.64, "end": 728.02}, {"text": "And what's the gas mileage like in a tank?", "start": 728.08, "end": 730.0}, {"text": "I don't know.", "start": 730.66, "end": 731.58}, {"text": "Maybe like five miles per gallon.", "start": 731.76, "end": 733.38}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 733.5, "end": 733.8}, {"text": "They run on diesel, which is a different type of fuel, right?", "start": 733.8, "end": 736.9}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 737.04, "end": 737.18}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 737.42, "end": 737.52}, {"text": "Well, very cool.", "start": 737.6, "end": 738.3}, {"text": "I never knew that my podcast partner had driven a tank.", "start": 738.3, "end": 742.06}, {"text": "That's pretty awesome.", "start": 742.2, "end": 742.82}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 743.04, "end": 743.12}, {"text": "Well, it was fun, definitely.", "start": 743.24, "end": 744.9}, {"text": "And I hope I get to do it again someday.", "start": 744.9, "end": 746.94}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 747.24, "end": 747.54}, {"text": "Well, guys, have you ever driven a tank?", "start": 747.92, "end": 751.38}, {"text": "Or a submarine or any type of armored vehicle?", "start": 751.64, "end": 755.34}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 755.56, "end": 755.72}, {"text": "Tell us about it at our website, englishpod.com.", "start": 755.86, "end": 759.14}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 759.52, "end": 759.94}, {"text": "We'll be there to answer all your questions.", "start": 759.94, "end": 761.7}, {"text": "I'll also be there to maybe post some more crazy stories.", "start": 761.92, "end": 764.98}, {"text": "Or some pictures of a tank or something.", "start": 765.14, "end": 766.78}, {"text": "Yeah, maybe.", "start": 766.78, "end": 767.04}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 767.26, "end": 767.34}, {"text": "All right, guys.", "start": 767.74, "end": 768.26}, {"text": "We'll see you there.", "start": 768.4, "end": 768.86}, {"text": "Until then, it's...", "start": 768.98, "end": 769.72}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 769.72, "end": 770.0}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 770.18, "end": 770.32}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 770.6, "end": 770.74}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 770.74, "end": 771.0}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 772.0, "end": 772.36}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 772.54, "end": 772.9}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 773.06, "end": 773.24}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 773.64, "end": 773.82}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 774.36, "end": 774.44}, {"text": "", "start": 775.38, "end": 775.38}, {"text": "", "start": 775.38, "end": 775.38}, {"text": "", "start": 775.38, "end": 775.38}, {"text": "", "start": 775.38, "end": 775.38}, {"text": "", "start": 775.38, "end": 775.38}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 775.5, "end": 775.68}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.78}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 777.78, "end": 777.9}, {"text": "", "start": 777.9, "end": 777.9}, {"text": "", "start": 777.9, "end": 777.9}, {"text": "", "start": 777.9, "end": 777.9}, {"text": "", "start": 777.9, "end": 777.9}]